      }
    },
    "Reads newly observed text that Notification Center exposes through Accessibility. Hidden, grouped or brief banners can be missed; this is not a complete Mac notification feed. The test button checks the delivery path without requiring a Mac banner. Connected devices receive an inbox item. Background iOS alerts require a signed iOS build with Push Notifications, notification permission, and matching APNs topic and environment. APNs sends the mirrored title and body through Apple. Keep the .p8 file outside the app and repository; Sill stores only its path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Reads newly observed text that Notification Center exposes through Accessibility. Hidden, grouped or brief banners can be missed; this is not a complete Mac notification feed. The test button checks the delivery path without requiring a Mac banner. Connected devices receive an inbox item. Background iOS alerts require a signed iOS build with Push Notifications, notification permission, and matching APNs topic and environment. APNs sends the mirrored title and body through Apple. Keep the .p8 file outside the app and repository; Sill stores only its path."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "读取通知中心通过辅助功能公开的新通知文本。隐藏、分组或短暂显示的横幅可能被遗漏；这里并非完整的 Mac 通知列表。测试按钮无需 Mac 横幅即可检查传送路径。已连接设备会收到收件箱条目。iOS 后台提醒需要启用推送通知的签名版本、通知权限，以及匹配的 APNs 主题和环境。APNs 通过 Apple 发送镜像通知的标题和正文。请将 .p8 文件保存在 App 和代码仓库之外；Sill 只保存其路径。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "讀取通知中心透過輔助使用公開的新通知文字。隱藏、分組或短暫顯示的橫幅可能被遺漏；這裡並非完整的 Mac 通知列表。測試按鈕無需 Mac 橫幅即可檢查傳送路徑。已連線裝置會收到收件匣項目。iOS 背景提醒需要啟用推播通知的簽署版本、通知權限，以及相符的 APNs 主題和環境。APNs 透過 Apple 傳送鏡像通知的標題和內文。請將 .p8 檔案保存在 App 和程式碼儲存庫之外；Sill 只儲存其路徑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
