            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 無法使用鑰匙圈中的金鑰。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill couldn’t use its key in your keychain. Quit Sill and open it again, and choose Always Allow if the keychain asks."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 未能使用钥匙串中的密钥。请退出并重新打开 Sill；若钥匙串弹出询问，请选择“始终允许”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 無法使用鑰匙圈中的金鑰。請結束並重新開啟 Sill；若鑰匙圈詢問，請選擇「永遠允許」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sill reads macOS’s retained notification database without modifying it. This requires Full Disk Access, and the system’s database format may change with macOS updates. Notifications that disappear before they are saved may be missed. Sill stores its own notification history locally and can sync it when a paired device reconnects. The test button checks delivery without requiring a Mac notification. Background iOS alerts require a signed iOS fork with Push Notifications, notification permission, and matching APNs topic and environment. APNs sends the mirrored title and body through Apple. Keep the .p8 file outside the app and repository; Sill stores only its path.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill reads macOS’s retained notification database without modifying it. This requires Full Disk Access, and the system’s database format may change with macOS updates. Notifications that disappear before they are saved may be missed. Sill stores its own notification history locally and can sync it when a paired device reconnects. The test button checks delivery without requiring a Mac notification. Background iOS alerts require a signed iOS fork with Push Notifications, notification permission, and matching APNs topic and environment. APNs sends the mirrored title and body through Apple. Keep the .p8 file outside the app and repository; Sill stores only its path."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 只读取 macOS 保留的通知数据库，不会修改它。这需要完全磁盘访问权限，系统数据库格式可能随 macOS 更新而改变。保存前已消失的通知可能会遗漏。Sill 将自己的通知历史保存在本地，配对设备重新连接时可以同步。测试按钮可在没有 Mac 通知时检查发送链路。iOS 后台提醒需要已签名且启用推送通知的 iOS fork、通知权限，以及匹配的 APNs 主题和环境。APNs 会通过 Apple 发送转发的标题和正文。请将 .p8 文件保存在应用和仓库之外；Sill 只保存其路径。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sill 只讀取 macOS 保留的通知資料庫，不會修改它。這需要完全磁碟存取權限，系統資料庫格式可能隨 macOS 更新而改變。儲存前已消失的通知可能會遺漏。Sill 將自己的通知記錄儲存在本機，配對裝置重新連線時可以同步。測試按鈕可在沒有 Mac 通知時檢查傳送流程。iOS 背景提醒需要已簽署且啟用推播通知的 iOS fork、通知權限，以及相符的 APNs 主題和環境。APNs 會透過 Apple 傳送轉送的標題和內文。請將 .p8 檔案儲存在應用程式和儲存庫之外；Sill 只儲存其路徑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
